          "eligibilityDescription_md": "\n1. The applicant must be a farmer.\n1. The farmer should have taken a short-term crop loan during the Kharif season (1st April to 30th September) from any of the following:\n\n  - Primary Agricultural Credit Cooperative Society\n  - District Central Cooperative Bank\n  - Nationalized Bank\n  - Gramin Bank\n  - Private Bank\n\n1. The farmer should have repaid the loan on time.\n\n"
