          ],
          "benefits_md": "<br>\n\n**Name of Component**\t**Standard of Assistance****Minimum Time Limit (in Year) for Reclaiming Benefits**COP-34, Financial assistance to farmer for Interest Subvention4% interest subvention on timely repayment of crop loan taken by farmers up to ₹3,00,000/-only once in a financial year<br>\n\n",
          "briefDescription": "Under this scheme, financial assistance in the form of interest subvention is provided to farmers who repay their crop loans on time, helping them improve their agricultural productivity and economic well-being.\n\n",
          "detailedDescription": [
            {
              "children": [
                {
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "text": "The scheme \"COP-34 Financial Assistance to Farmer for Interest Subvention (Kishan Credit Card Interest Asst.)\" introduced by the Agriculture, Farmers Welfare and Cooperation Department, Gujarat, aims to support farmers by offering a 4% interest subvention on crop loans up to ₹3 lakh, provided the loan is repaid on time. This assistance helps farmers reduce their financial burden, improve crop yield, and enhance their income. It also encourages responsible financial practices among farmers."
                    }
                  ],
                  "type": "paragraph"
                }
              ],
              "type": "align_justify"
            }
          ],
          "detailedDescription_md": "The scheme &amp;quot;COP-34 Financial Assistance to Farmer for Interest Subvention (Kishan Credit Card Interest Asst.)&amp;quot; introduced by the Agriculture, Farmers Welfare and Cooperation Department, Gujarat, aims to support farmers by offering a 4% interest subvention on crop loans up to ₹3 lakh, provided the loan is repaid on time. This assistance helps farmers reduce their financial burden, improve crop yield, and enhance their income. It also encourages responsible financial practices among farmers.\n",
